          {
            "title": "Example: Syntax",
            "id": 91813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the code block so that it is free of syntax errors.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"member = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" member \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Happy Birthday, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + member)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"member\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Happy Birthday, Jason\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>[</code> followed by <code>]</code> and then <code>print</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check membership in a list. Display <code>Happy Birthday, Jason</code> without requesting user input.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"member = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" member \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Happy Birthday, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + member)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"member\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"input\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Happy Birthday, Jason\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>[</code>, followed by <code>]</code>, <code>print</code>, <code>(</code>, and finally <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91806,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why does the following code raise an <code>IndexError</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"180\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores[\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 2, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    scores[5]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The index is out of range</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores</code> is undefined</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores</code> is not a dictionary</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The index is out of range.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which expression accesses the final score, <code>180</code>, without raising an <code>IndexError</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"180\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores[\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 2, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    scores[5]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>scores[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores[180]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>scores[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Symbols",
            "id": 91817,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Write a statement which will not result in an error.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_a = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_b = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team_a &gt; team_b:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Team A won the game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Team A won the game\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Print <code>Team A won the game</code> only when <code>team_a</code> has a higher score than <code>team_b</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_a = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_b = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team_a &gt; team_b:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Team A won the game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Team A won the game\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, and finally <code>print</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which type of error will the following code raise?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"maximum = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;50&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" &lt; maximum: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;OK&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") \" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if &quot;50&quot; &lt; maximum:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"TypeError: &quot;&lt;&quot; not supported between instances of &quot;str&quot; and &quot;int&quot;\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>TypeError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>NameError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>TypeError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If you replace <code>\"50\"</code> with <code>50</code>, what happens when you run the code?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"maximum = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;50&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" &lt; maximum: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;OK&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") \" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if &quot;50&quot; &lt; maximum:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"TypeError: &quot;&lt;&quot; not supported between instances of &quot;str&quot; and &quot;int&quot;\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It finishes without printing anything.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It prints OK.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It still raises TypeError.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">It raises NameError.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It finishes without printing anything.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Where in the following code will the <code>SyntaxError</code> be identified?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"table_size = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tables_required)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                             ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>tables_required = guests table_size</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>guests = 24</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(tables_required)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>tables_required = guests table_size</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which replacement for the third line removes the <code>SyntaxError</code> and calculates the number of tables?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"table_size = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tables_required)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                             ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>tables_required = guests / table_size</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>tables_required = guests table_size</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>tables_required = guests + \"table_size\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>tables_required = guests / table_size</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: the `else` keyword",
            "id": 92548,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Print the message only if the calculation can be made.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"people = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / people\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Your share is \" /><text value=\"{str(share)}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" units.&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"raise\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"finally\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your share is 0.5 units.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>pass</code>, followed by <code>else</code>, and finally <code>prin</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Divide the total among the people. Handle failure without raising an error, and print the message only after success.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"people = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / people\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Your share is \" /><text value=\"{str(share)}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" units.&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"raise\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"finally\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your share is 0.5 units.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>/</code>, followed by <code>pass</code>, <code>else</code>, and finally <code>print</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Raise an exception",
            "id": 91239,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How can we raise an exception where we define the error message?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>raise Exception</code> followed by a string containing the message in parentheses</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Using a <code>print()</code> statement</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">With the <code>except</code> keyword</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>raise Exception</code> followed by a string containing the message in parentheses.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We define an exception message by placing its string in <code>raise Exception(...)</code>.</p><p>Which line raises an exception with the message <code>Invalid age</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>raise Exception(\"Invalid age\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(\"Invalid age\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except \"Invalid age\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>raise Exception(\"Invalid age\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Data validation",
            "id": 91909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What type of error might we throw if an input value is not suitable for our program?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>NameError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>ValueError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A program receives an age of <code>-4</code>. The input exists, but its value is not suitable. Which error should the program raise?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError</code>, because the value is invalid.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>NameError</code>, because the age variable has no value.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code>, because the input breaks Python syntax.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ValueError</code>, because the value is invalid.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: the `else` keyword",
            "id": 92542,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What will the following code block output?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"trips = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" / \" /><text value=\"&quot;Berlin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"raise\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  trips += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(trips)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 7, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    raise ValueError(&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ValueError: Calculation not possible\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Berlin</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What will the following code block output?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"trips = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" / \" /><text value=\"&quot;Berlin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"raise\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  trips += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(trips)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 7, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    raise ValueError(&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ValueError: Calculation not possible\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Berlin</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>Calculation not possible</code> without the exception type</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: the `finally` keyword",
            "id": 92550,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add the <code>except</code> branch to this code.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ellie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Rachel&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aubrey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"user = \" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  users.index(user)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome back, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + user)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Do you want to become a member?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"finally\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;See our web site for offers for both members and non-member.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"126\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Welcome back, John\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"See our web site for offers for both members and non-member.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>except</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
